  "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong>该模组需要 </strong></strong><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></strong><strong><strong> 才能运行！</strong></strong></span></h1><h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\">所谓的“死亡天使”从太空降临，能在瞬间杀死任何生物……但它们看不见。</span></h3><h3><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">你必须在这样一个世界里生存：你发出的任何声响都可能成为你的葬歌。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">没有武器能杀死它们，没有墙壁能阻挡它们，它们唯一的弱点是高频声波——利用它来保护自己。</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075055/description_27f79b15-d440-4b05-af00-647f063da45b.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"407\" height=\"305\"></span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此外，羊毛能隔绝大部分声音，让怪物无法察觉，例如你可以在上面安全地放置方块。</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\">相关视频：</span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vOhOEkFBl-A\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MN6T3DcCTO0\" width=\"609\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voiceless-survival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e848b46b61801d90eb7cf4a9934647fa96aa1e46.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></a><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本模组兼容 <strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voiceless-survival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Voiceless Survival</a></strong>，若你想让死亡天使听到你的声音，可以使用它。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">目前可能存在一些 Bug，但后续会修复。</span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\">感谢 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/armilp_ez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">armilp</a> 让这一切成为可能！</span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><em>也感谢大家的反馈和游玩我的模组！没有你们，它可能至今仍是一堆低劣的玩意儿。</em></h2><p>&nbsp;</p>",
